{"seq":1,"slug":"a-scholar-from-hunan","title":"A Scholar From Hunan","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-scholar-from-hunan","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"humble-origins","title":"寒门子弟","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-scholar-from-hunan/humble-origins","wordCount":1996,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"examination-and-officialdom","title":"科举与仕途","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-scholar-from-hunan/examination-and-officialdom","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章追溯曾国藩的出身与早年。他出身湖南湘乡的普通农家——一个寒门，深受祖父家训的影响，资质平常却以超乎常人的勤奋弥补不足。他通过科举步入仕途，考中进士、进入翰林院，并在京城为官期间潜心于学问与修身，开始了严格的自我修养。本章呈现\"湖南寒门子弟\"曾国藩厚积薄发的奋斗起点。\n"}